{"unit_id":"frederico-kluser__dsh-goal-pause-guard#card-zh","repo":"frederico-kluser/dsh-goal-pause-guard","commit":"da751ec533cb0b484377fea152aff90b45702625","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-goal-pause-guard 是 DSH Web 端的目标暂停确认插件。它在文档捕获目标栏暂停按钮点击，并在界面处理前显示弹窗；确认后重新定位当前可用按钮并触发暂停，取消、Esc 或点击遮罩均不执行。插件通过中英文 aria-label 或暂停图标识别按钮，弹窗提供英、中、葡语文案，并说明暂停会停止当前回合和运行中的子任务。适合希望避免误暂停目标的用户，无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/guard-core.ts:66-77","client/guard-core.ts:289-343","client/index.ts:41-48"]}
{"unit_id":"frederico-kluser__dsh-goal-pause-guard#card-en","repo":"frederico-kluser/dsh-goal-pause-guard","commit":"da751ec533cb0b484377fea152aff90b45702625","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-goal-pause-guard adds a confirmation modal before pausing a DSH web goal. It intercepts goal bar pause clicks. Confirm activates the current button; cancel, Escape, or backdrop click leaves the goal running. It recognizes labels or the pause icon. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/guard-core.ts:66-77","client/guard-core.ts:289-343","client/index.ts:41-48"]}
