{"unit_id":"frederico-kluser__dsh-goal-pause-guard#feature-1","repo":"frederico-kluser/dsh-goal-pause-guard","commit":"da751ec533cb0b484377fea152aff90b45702625","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-goal-pause-guard 的功能「暂停确认」：点击目标栏的暂停按钮时，插件在捕获阶段拦截点击并打开确认弹窗；确认才会触发当前暂停按钮，取消则不操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/guard-core.ts:298-335"]}
